From: WuShFeng <1481542813@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 20:33:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 23/24] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20init=E9=9C=80=E8=A6=81=E5=90=8C?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E6=97=B6=E6=93=8D=E4=BD=9C=E4=B8=A4=E4=B8=AAchip?=
